    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 173,
        "text": "Okay, team, let's look at the weekend market survey. We collected 120 forms, but only 86 are complete. That's a problem because incomplete forms can affect the results.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "a72aad59486f06c588c11575dfc8ee152ab91368a4c9c3eb9bbd174dbc121828",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 180,
        "sourceEnd": 349,
        "text": "Right. So the response rate is about 72 percent. But wait—most of those 86 came from the morning. The afternoon was quieter, so we have fewer responses from that period.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "4d32d39e29875d7b36fb46f9f8fbdeafa19a30000352abf587df04cf20b04c04",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 356,
        "sourceEnd": 542,
        "text": "Exactly. There were more older visitors in the morning and fewer young people all day. So our sample is not balanced. This means we cannot easily generalise the findings to all visitors.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "ce1bfe8eb8966f5c16e66d9a22da64723c72d31c4e8c607d68273190721a9996",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 549,
        "sourceEnd": 739,
        "text": "And there was one question about prices. Some people wrote 'cheap', some wrote 'too expensive'. The answers are not consistent, so it is hard to draw a clear conclusion about price opinions.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "8303bd889c0f97423bdc06041cf6aa8d47ae2b2fb117aca0d20f343c36455ad7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 746,
        "sourceEnd": 932,
        "text": "Good point. Also, the trend in the data is clear: sales went up after 11 a.m., then fell after 2 p.m. But we can't say why. We would need more detailed information to explain the reason.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "21816475eb8edc34c7ed7895c4d2c6d4d92cb47c60da4e6a5adda76175cf04d9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 939,
        "sourceEnd": 1036,
        "text": "Can we compare this with last year's survey? Last year we had 150 forms, so this year is smaller.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "5e73f2162ec55770b5c909723c5a327f98d980a04d69df70dd94db9a7bba89a8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1043,
        "sourceEnd": 1162,
        "text": "Yes, but last year's questions were different. We can't compare the two directly. That's a limit of this year's survey.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "daa8ab35b0258c1ab9c184e3f938ba2993089a94acf7057030ab4f10364bf534",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1169,
        "sourceEnd": 1279,
        "text": "So what do we report? Maybe we say the survey shows a morning trend, but we need more data from the afternoon.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "e78bdf1fd5dcbbc3c37ad4f9a4c1dd55a7607b1b8c0027ecdc00db7c43063362",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1286,
        "sourceEnd": 1426,
        "text": "I agree. Let's write: 'There was a higher number of morning visitors, but the sample was small.' And we should mention the incomplete forms.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "c22b917f1ebdf484fbde3c57085bd344186337c77a5fb8f76b35b85f9ed52029",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1433,
        "sourceEnd": 1545,
        "text": "Okay. I'll make a simple chart: percentage of visitors by time of day. Morning 60 percent, afternoon 40 percent.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "6ed150e1010848d18fcbbd93dca3e789b31440571fe65bd2448debb887b36257",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1552,
        "sourceEnd": 1686,
        "text": "Wait, is that right? Let me check. Morning 52 forms, afternoon 34 forms. So morning is about 60 percent of the 86 complete forms. Yes.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "bd237ca92bd863bb1e62f5dd7d10469766f113cab3c9e43250e569a33a3985a4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1693,
        "sourceEnd": 1770,
        "text": "Good. And we can add a note: 'There were 34 incomplete forms.' That's honest.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "0500c7e13ee0d216e23ce5bd29bafd0382bd94f93783f6416419a9d8780bef69",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1777,
        "sourceEnd": 1820,
        "text": "Perfect. Let's finish the report by Friday.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "c0287485fd68c22d81ee844b5a50757d066321bd0f5058ce703c43e100cc3bac",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
